VENDORED UPSTREAM SOURCE

Lura and the KrakenD component set are NOT imported as external Go modules.
Commit e329c72b (2026-07-25) folded 34 github.com/luraproject and
github.com/krakend modules into this repository under internal/ and rewrote
their import paths onto github.com/hanzoai/gateway/v2. `go list -m all` and
go.sum contain no krakend or lura entry; the source is shipped here instead.
That makes this repository a redistributor of that source, so each vendored
component's upstream LICENSE travels with it in its own directory (31 LICENSE
files) and the components are enumerated below.

